_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFe3YV5hondAfUpxyMZdpgecBhr0fJAqkzn9-6ynqhB1w&oe=6A75C450"}]}, "id": "2090799601673742", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2228903784188320", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619697_2228903787521653_7691527680346820636_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0gdaA38Yr2sQ7kNvwF9p534&_nc_oc=AdquxjRnLTHNZDLwlMD-5m2NK68BfUBTSKuwSXF70puM1Jto_CpYsVJ-CpHLGTxwZsY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF5grKByTFIKF0xIbjKgaeYydAzpJ4Y47xE3tNCFhAE4w&oe=6A75CECC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1152286369897580", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_1152286373230913_5226934959439945484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9QpDNUft15MQ7kNvwHhdMm_&_nc_oc=AdoBoknbQGUeMxNdD_FDLszDvjAeGbROrTJVjWSAQPyiLMUJkn2gJRoJmZDQq22NQVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF31j-qEn-l881be_ZJTno18rnTxIGbJmrn_owU4KQG5A&oe=6A75F785"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u56fe1.png", "id": "684521228053278", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_684521231386611_6623603831782279089_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yLq8xrqeQQEQ7kNvwFQS7lX&_nc_oc=Adoo9O4NhBuLL5C2H6JI5UIGUg6UpvSFEw2x6yKuu-NxbBBFt6VECbPEmbR1JUmGrZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQErlPojV-_qQov28DMZBJN1hd1XSqgbHOXH75iFYXtYWA&oe=6A75D099"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1388131016268349", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822045_1388131019601682_113874591060992121_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iOIp7C_C9rUQ7kNvwGjOcOK&_nc_oc=AdqOyPkQhXd7KcozO0ODOIH5wFSfa4qlPIKE64Iius-b5u6w5RZWQnV0K1Ah3xfBc3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHg8wWW3CeBFSYpmumPCU60V2wjtNSQVGbHlnqb-Y_GYw&oe=6A75E65D"}, {"file_name": "444.png", "id": "779906775198861", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314659_779906778532194_1744895043394346610_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X_rC5PKDx1wQ7kNvwEugZLY&_nc_oc=Ado9o-3ayi8Uu7qB-6Km757quibWVxnc_9Vnxmxwz214OIN1smduJvsxWx0_HfE03hs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHt7fCRSFGJo5jgzU76cmIfz2f-RXQdaGfg3i8zx-NC-g&oe=6A75C354"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1950760892146935", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_1950760898813601_5680159503057088351_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P1K8uAouYMYQ7kNvwFMy2d3&_nc_oc=Adqxs0PvDlvkk3vqI6llf5VLGzUS8cW5PgDSPYBKZ15jF96KpwXS3YcHs_RENTnqcoc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEdoDF9UJ408IB78dEAPGvEEn5uG6ppz67NkLFVNWfI_g&oe=6A75DBEC"}, "display_name": "Umbrella Up", "keywords": ["horror", "adventure", "simulator", "sandbox", "climb"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf83 **Umbrella Up: Horror Mode** \u2602\ufe0f\ud83d\udc80\n\n**You think your umbrellas can protect you?**\nThink again.\n\nWelcome to **Umbrella Up: Horror Mode** \u2014 where a *cute snowman* turns into a *survivor in the dark*. \ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f\n\nThe lights are out. The park\u2019s empty.\nSomething\u2019s breathing right behind you. \ud83d\udc40\nUse your umbrellas to glide, hide, and escape \u2014\nand try to survive inside this cursed amusement park.\n{1094397659433664}\nEvery shadow hides a secret.\nEvery sound could be your last warning.\nFog, flickering lights, distant laughter...\nEverything feels *off*. \ud83d\udd26\ud83d\udc7b\n\n**Just remember \u2014 don\u2019t let the lights go out.**\nWhen they do\u2026 you\u2019ll find out what\u2019s really waiting for you.\n\n## \ud83d\udc80 **Game Features**\n\n- **Haunted Theme Park Map** \u2014 thicker fog, jump scares, dynamic lighting\n- **Battery Panic System** \u2014 find batteries before your flashlight dies! \ud83d\udd0b\n- **Creepy & Funny Skins** \u2014 from *Ghost Umbrellas* to *Cursed Snowmen*\n- **Hidden Stories & Easter Eggs** \u2014 only the brave will uncover them\n\n\ud83c\udf19 **Dare to open your umbrella in the dark?**\n{1387940046384292}", "short_description": "This ain\u2019t your chill VR game anymore \u2014 it\u2019s pure chaos! \ud83d\udca5\nPop open your umbrella \ud83c\udf02 and jump into the storm! \ud83e\ude82\n\n\ud83c\udf02 One tool, endless tricks:\n\ud83e\uddd7 Climb \uff5c\ud83e\udebd Glide \uff5c\ud83e\ude82 Parachute \uff5c\u2694\ufe0f Attack \uff5c\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defend \uff5c\ud83d\udeeb Fly \uff5c\ud83d\udd2b Shoot\n\nPlay solo or with friends \u2014 survive the madness, race to the top, and make a scene in the sky! \u2601\ufe0f\ud83c\udfa2"}]}, "developer_name": "Monstarai", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.umbrellaupvr.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tyche Mobile Technology Inc Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.umbrellaupvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25499516983074479"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_2245062385961675_3830592801937478287_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E655gaWPZZcQ7kNvwG2dFAd&_nc_oc=Adr-ppLMcXSbkfymHyD_faABs1d43TCjf_F9WwMv9Sb